{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29193","headline":"春雨舟中次和横江裴使君见迎李赵二秀才同来因书四韵兼寄江南 · 许浑","name":"春雨舟中次和横江裴使君见迎李赵二秀才同来因书四韵兼寄江南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳草渡头微雨时，万株杨柳拂波垂。\n蒲根水暖鴈初落，梅径香寒蜂未知。\n词客倚风吹暗淡，使君回马湿旌旗。\n江南仲蔚多情调，怅望青云几首诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29193.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29193","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}